"""What the album says about each cell (图鉴的提示).

HINTS[kind:key] = (riddle, nudge, plain)
  riddle: for what is not found yet.  A password more than an answer: enough to guess most of it, never the thing
          itself.  How dark it is goes with how rare the thing is: everyday ones are nearly said, rare ones are not.
  nudge:  the second hint ("one more hint" on the blackboard); "" if the riddle already says enough.
  plain:  once it is found, how it comes about, said straight (the fun of finding it is over; now it is a manual).
HINTS is Chinese, HINTS_EN English (the album takes the one of the pets' language).
"""

